Job Description 

1. Responsible for driving the sales performance of xiaomi/redmi/poco products on Argentina/latam online platforms;

2. Working closely with distributors and e-commerce platforms in order to ensure smooth order fulfillment;

3. Managing and executing promotion plans and new product launches;

4. Responsible for collecting and analyzing sales data and user feedback, providing market insights on brand performance and increase market share locally;

5. Monitor and research into market trends and competitors, plan and execute sales/marketing strategy.




Job requirements

1. More than 3 years of experience on latam e-commerce platforms, familiar with latam online market;

2. Skilled in data analysis and obtain valuable insights from market and sales data;

3. Good communication skills, able to communicate effectively with internal team and partners;

4. Fluent English and Spanish prefered.

